# Raw per-node model outputs — regenerable, noisy, per-model. The scored summaries
# (results/<model>-score.json, results/comparison.json) and the final per-transcript
# DECIDE outputs (results/<model>/NN-slug.json) ARE committed; the raw node dumps and
# intermediates are not.
results/*/*/plan.txt
results/*/*/locate.txt
results/*/*/decide.txt
results/*/*/plan.json
results/*/*/locate.json
results/*/*/decide.json
results/*/*/gated.json
